{"id":"033ae2350b8aa66a","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-topo9-density.md","title":"ZFC Topo9 Density","display":"df-zfc-topo9-density — ZFC Topo9 Density","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo9-density","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo9-density"],"display":"df-zfc-topo9-density — ZFC Topo9 Density","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo9-density"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo9-density</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo9-density — ZFC Topo9 Density"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"855dfa27460aa1ec\" href=\"?note=855dfa27460aa1ec\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,D,\\delta\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,D,\\delta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (dense-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"855dfa27460aa1ec\" href=\"?note=855dfa27460aa1ec\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Density}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Density}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}density} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Density}_S(X,\\tau,\\delta)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\\bigl(\\exists D\\subseteq X\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,D)\\land\\delta=|D|)\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(\\forall E\\subseteq X\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,E)\\to\\delta\\leq|E|)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}density} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Density}_S(X,\\tau,\\delta)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\\bigl(\\exists D\\subseteq X\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,D)\\land\\delta=|D|)\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(\\forall E\\subseteq X\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,E)\\to\\delta\\leq|E|)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary cardinal invariant definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"855dfa27460aa1ec","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (topological-space predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"855dfa27460aa1ec","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (dense-set predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V$ (cardinal predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,D,\\delta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Density}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}density} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Density}_S(X,\\tau,\\delta)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\\bigl(\\exists D\\subseteq X\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,D)\\land\\delta=|D|)\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(\\forall E\\subseteq X\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,E)\\to\\delta\\leq|E|)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1333,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3726","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-topo9-density.md|58-df-zfc-topo9-density]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","855dfa27460aa1ec","815e63e5071e7b58","5fb1c2241d1943d1","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}